Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_COST,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOW 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_END_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_QOY = 1 AND 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_PROMO_SK >= 178


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.P_COST AS "P_COST",
  Q2.D_DOW AS "D_DOW" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.P_END_DATE_SK) AND 
  (178 <= Q1.P_PROMO_SK) AND 
  (Q2.D_QOY = 1)

Explain level:    Explain from section

